# MELVORE — COMPLETE CUSTOMER APP REDESIGN & COMMERCE EXPERIENCE

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Transform the existing Melvore Android application into a premium, visually immersive, highly interactive fashion-shopping platform.

The app should combine the speed, simplicity and effortless navigation of modern quick-commerce apps such as Blinkit and Zepto with the editorial fashion experience of premium international fashion platforms.

Do not copy their branding or exact interface. Use their excellent UX principles: immediate discovery, fast search, clear navigation, personalized content, smooth scrolling and minimal friction.

Melvore is a fashion discovery and shopping destination focused on modern, distinctive, expressive and unique clothing, including Y2K, Korean fashion, Gothic, streetwear, oversized fashion, minimal fashion, coquette and other emerging aesthetics.

The experience must make users want to explore, scroll, discover new brands, watch product videos and try different styles.

**MOST IMPORTANT REQUIREMENT: Almost all homepage content, promotional sections, creative assets, animations, festival campaigns, style collections, brand placements, products and editorial layouts must be managed dynamically through the existing PHP/MySQL backend.**

Do not build a static mockup. Build a functional shopping application connected to the live database.

